Package: niflowr
Title: Spec-Driven Neuroimaging Command-Line Tool Wrappers
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Bradley", "Buchsbaum", email = "brad.buchsbaum@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A lightweight, declarative framework for wrapping neuroimaging
    command-line tools (FSL, AFNI, ANTs, FreeSurfer) in R. Tool interfaces are
    defined as JSON specifications that describe inputs, outputs, CLI rendering
    rules, and validation constraints. The package builds safe argument vectors
    (never shell strings), executes via 'processx', captures provenance, and
    integrates with 'targets' for pipeline orchestration.
